      "headline": "Fushimi Inari at dawn",
      "body": "Shoes off, phone down, eyes up. You’ll have the torii tunnels nearly to yourself before the buses roll in.",
      "item_id": "0199a0f2-0000-7000-8000-00000000f001"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Nishiki Market",
      "body": "Grazing is a sport here. Go early, point at what looks good, and let breakfast find you.",
      "item_id": "0199a0f2-0000-7000-8000-00000000f002"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Kaiseki dinner in Gion",
      "body": "A kaiseki (multi-course Kyoto meal) rewards slow eating. You’ll want the evening to drag a little.",
      "item_id": "0199a0f2-0000-7000-8000-00000000f004"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Nara, only if you like",
      "body": "The deer will cope without you. If you skip it, that’s $64 back in your pocket.",
      "item_id": "0199a0f2-0000-7000-8000-00000000f003"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Your Kyoto rhythm",
      "body": "Up with the temple bells, fed by the market, home before the lanterns get loud.",
      "item_id": null
    }
  ],
